  "bio": "Juliette Watier is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in realism, dotwork, and black & gray styles at Sacredeye Tattoos in Fort Lauderdale, United States. Known for her meticulous attention to detail, Juliette effortlessly brings her clients' visions to life, ensuring each piece is a stunning work of art. Her professionalism resonates not only in her exceptional tattooing talent but also in her organized booking system, which is essential for planning your next ink session with her.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Fort Lauderdale, Florida, United States\n\n📍SoFlo \nBooking Apr-Jun\nNord, France: Summer\nDeposit req’d (non-refundable) \nFinancing on @cocreateink \nTikTok: Julestattoos\nEco 🌱\n@bananatattoo.co",
